      "message": "Can I suggest `emplace_back` instead? That\u0027s actually tracking with std::vector:\n\nhttps://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/vector/emplace_back\n\nReturns a reference instead of a pointer, but that\u0027s just different notation. We can add the support for passing `Args...` in a followup if we ever need it.",
