      "writtenOn": "2022-10-19T13:04:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you mean emplace_back() as a way to add a single item. append() matches the SkTDArray API. Part of our goal is bringing the SkTDArray and SkTArray APIs together. I view append as a shorthand for insert where the start is at fEnd. insert() returns a pointer. And returning a pointer makes sense when this is expanded to append(int n) because then you have a pointer to the array of elements you can change.",
      "parentUuid": "6855c31d_e14d2eb7",
      "revId": "163070537f10e14a8227b1a4dec03b786cde56a4",
