        "id": 11059
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-19T15:19:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In practice, I actually prefer the `emplace_back` behavior.\nIf we assign into the value immediately, the optimizer will notice this and can eliminate the extra store.\nIf we _don\u0027t_ assign into the value immediately, I\u0027d rather have a value-initialized object than uninitialized garbage.",
      "parentUuid": "a48a7e43_62f4a18b",
      "revId": "163070537f10e14a8227b1a4dec03b786cde56a4",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
